<Project Sdk="AsmFoundation.Sdk">
  <!--
    The GrpcAsm engine: HTTP/2 (h2n), HPACK (hpack), the gRPC call layer (grpc), the epoll
    worker (worker), the per-worker allocator (pool), structured logging (log) and helpers
    (util), moved out of KvAsm (AsmFoundation/KvAsm server/src at 60d7e81).

    Milestone B: step 1 split the files, step 2 renamed the engine's exports to ga_*, step 3
    made the application hooks the only way the engine calls out (the ga_app_* symbols declared
    and documented in include/grpcasm_hooks.inc, which an application such as samples/KvServer
    defines and the linker binds), and step 4 moved the generic half of KvAsm's grpc.asm in
    here (body buffering, validation, the health service, stream release). The next step
    replaces the fixed routes with route tables (docs/ROADMAP.md).
  -->
  <PropertyGroup>
    <OutputType>StaticLibrary</OutputType>
    <AsmLibraryName>grpcasm</AsmLibraryName>
  </PropertyGroup>
</Project>
